{
  "frames": [
    {
      "frame_number": 1,
      "caption": "I woke at daylight to find Queequeg\u2019s tattooed arm thrown over me, so blended with the patchwork counterpane that only its weight told me he was hugging me.",
      "caption_zone": "top_left",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_frames/frame_001.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_lettered_frames/frame_001.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 2,
      "caption": "I tried to free myself and rouse him, rolled, felt a slight scratch, and, throwing aside the counterpane, I saw his tomahawk-pipe lying by his side.",
      "caption_zone": "bottom_left",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_frames/frame_002.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_lettered_frames/frame_002.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1545,
        "y2": 1018
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 3,
      "caption": "By much wriggling and loud expostulations I woke him; he drew back his arm, shook himself, and sat up staring, while I lay quiet and curious rather than afraid.",
      "caption_zone": "top_center",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_frames/frame_003.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_lettered_frames/frame_003.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1618,
        "y2": 972
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 4,
      "caption": "He made signs that he would dress first and then leave me to dress alone\u2014a very civilized overture I accepted as I watched him.",
      "caption_zone": "bottom_right",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_frames/frame_004.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_lettered_frames/frame_004.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1597,
        "y2": 985
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 5,
      "caption": "I watched him begin at the top with his very tall beaver hat, hunt up his boots, crawl under the bed to pull them on, and limp creaking about the room.",
      "caption_zone": "top_right",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_frames/frame_005.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_lettered_frames/frame_005.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 6,
      "caption": "Seeing there were no curtains and the house opposite looked in, I begged him to hasten into his pantaloons, whereupon he complied and washed only his chest, arms, and hands.",
      "caption_zone": "bottom_center",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_frames/frame_006.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_lettered_frames/frame_006.png",
      "frame_box": {
        "x1": 0,
        "y1": 0,
        "x2": 1536,
        "y2": 1024
      }
    },
    {
      "frame_number": 7,
      "caption": "Then I saw him coolly shave with the head of his harpoon, and, his toilet complete, he marched out in his pilot monkey jacket, sporting the harpoon like a marshal\u2019s baton.",
      "caption_zone": "top_left",
      "source_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_frames/frame_007.png",
      "lettered_image": "work/mobydick/graphic_novel/action_spine_v3/chapter_004/final_lettered_frames/frame_007.png",
      "frame_box": {
